{"4607560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crabbin' Crew", "steam_appid": 4607560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4757450], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome aboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 3 other employees have been selected for a rewarding opportunity in <strong>interplanetary offshore resource extraction</strong>! Your responsibilities include catching crab, operating company equipment, and ensuring the vessel remains functional at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3927a2ee2e4495b5a3f5912048d3d0f1.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3927a2ee2e4495b5a3f5912048d3d0f1.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3927a2ee2e4495b5a3f5912048d3d0f1.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A functioning vessel needs a functioning crew. Coordinate roles across the ship to pilot through storms, operate deck machinery, haul traps, process catches, and keep critical systems online. One mistake can cost the entire haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/4912e64198ab352b0379742634e9203a.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/4912e64198ab352b0379742634e9203a.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/4912e64198ab352b0379742634e9203a.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CATCH EXOTIC SPECIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest valuable crab and deep-sea creatures from hostile planetary oceans. Different regions contain unique wildlife, environmental hazards, and increasingly unpredictable encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/d630749f6da41ce6bcb56c6d727226d4.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/d630749f6da41ce6bcb56c6d727226d4.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/d630749f6da41ce6bcb56c6d727226d4.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE UNKNOWN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange creatures stalk the fog, climb aboard the vessel, and interfere with operations. Please remain calm and continue working!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3a06a913d07ae1789db283de6bfad816.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3a06a913d07ae1789db283de6bfad816.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3a06a913d07ae1789db283de6bfad816.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP THE SHIP RUNNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair damaged systems, restore power, extinguish fires, and survive equipment failures while the quota clock keeps ticking. The ocean does not stop because you are busy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/abb19260435758e43d63bba7a96673a0.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/abb19260435758e43d63bba7a96673a0.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/abb19260435758e43d63bba7a96673a0.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully interactive fishing vessel requiring teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate cranes, traps, navigation, and ship systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based cargo and deck operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile sea monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotguns and bazookas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/f96daacafebb97bd8acb73a681cd8e3b.avif?t=1787523933\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras_big/f96daacafebb97bd8acb73a681cd8e3b.avif?t=1787523933 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome aboard!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and up to 3 other employees have been selected for a rewarding opportunity in <strong>interplanetary offshore resource extraction</strong>! Your responsibilities include catching crab, operating company equipment, and ensuring the vessel remains functional at all times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3927a2ee2e4495b5a3f5912048d3d0f1.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3927a2ee2e4495b5a3f5912048d3d0f1.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3927a2ee2e4495b5a3f5912048d3d0f1.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A functioning vessel needs a functioning crew. Coordinate roles across the ship to pilot through storms, operate deck machinery, haul traps, process catches, and keep critical systems online. One mistake can cost the entire haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/4912e64198ab352b0379742634e9203a.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/4912e64198ab352b0379742634e9203a.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/4912e64198ab352b0379742634e9203a.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CATCH EXOTIC SPECIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest valuable crab and deep-sea creatures from hostile planetary oceans. Different regions contain unique wildlife, environmental hazards, and increasingly unpredictable encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/d630749f6da41ce6bcb56c6d727226d4.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/d630749f6da41ce6bcb56c6d727226d4.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/d630749f6da41ce6bcb56c6d727226d4.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE UNKNOWN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange creatures stalk the fog, climb aboard the vessel, and interfere with operations. Please remain calm and continue working!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3a06a913d07ae1789db283de6bfad816.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3a06a913d07ae1789db283de6bfad816.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/3a06a913d07ae1789db283de6bfad816.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEEP THE SHIP RUNNING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair damaged systems, restore power, extinguish fires, and survive equipment failures while the quota clock keeps ticking. The ocean does not stop because you are busy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/abb19260435758e43d63bba7a96673a0.poster.avif?t=1787523933\" width=720 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/abb19260435758e43d63bba7a96673a0.webm?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/abb19260435758e43d63bba7a96673a0.mp4?t=1787523933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully interactive fishing vessel requiring teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate cranes, traps, navigation, and ship systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based cargo and deck operations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile sea monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shotguns and bazookas</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras/f96daacafebb97bd8acb73a681cd8e3b.avif?t=1787523933\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607560/extras_big/f96daacafebb97bd8acb73a681cd8e3b.avif?t=1787523933 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p>", "short_description": "An online co-op horror game for u